  "id": "tank-duel",
  "title": "Tank Duel",
  "tagline": "Five artillery duels. Wind, cover, five shells, one tank.",
  "description": "A turn-based artillery duel: you against an AI tank on a fresh hillside. Drag the lower screen to set angle and power, watch the sight arc, pick a shell and fire. Wind pushes every round, buildings are hard cover, and a ridge can block the flat shot, so a drill shell or a high lob is sometimes the only answer. After each shot a spotter reports how far you missed, so you can walk the next round in. The AI does the same to you, and it shoots first from sortie four. Five sorties, each with a tougher hull and a sharper gunner, three stars for a clean win, and your best score kept per sortie.",
